'''Ladybugs''' are a [[Curiosity]] which can be used in the [[Study Report]] to earn [[Learning Points]].

==How to Acquire==

You can acquire a ladybug by right-clicking them while they are flying around, just like [[Silkmoth]]s. They appear in [[Grassland]]s, [[Forest Terrain]]s, [[Moor]]s and possibly other areas.

